{:mulog/parent-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z1QQJfCx3fXKJV8jl03hGo-gHJC_5", :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z1QQJfCx3fXKJV8jl03hGo-gHJC_5", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z1QQS2cjS8PokJQAVuBgerzX3NeQA", :mulog/timestamp 1779242951929, :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/anomaly-in-todo-processor, :mulog/namespace "ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core", :anomaly {:cognitect.anomalies/category :cognitect.anomalies/fault, :cognitect.anomalies/message "Todo Processor returned nil: %s"}}
{:mulog/duration 556333, :mulog/namespace "ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core", :mulog/outcome :ok, :mulog/parent-trace nil, :event {:tick-id #uuid "b0d2f28a-c554-4adb-b103-20243dd4986a", :writes {:document-survey "### Comparison Survey: v2.0 vs. v3.1.1\n\n**1. Structural Narrative:**\nThe high-level structure (Part 1, Part 2, and Appendices A through E) remains identical between Version 2.0 and Version 3.1.1. No entire sections or appendices were added, removed, or reordered.\n\n**2. Key Structural Changes & Omissions:**\n*   **Domestic Content (Appendix C):** In Version 2.0, Appendix C contains extensive \"Domestic Content Requirements\" including detailed tables (Grids) for Crystalline Silicon, Thin-Film, and Concentrated PV technologies. In Version 3.1.1, these grids and associated calculation/verification criteria (Sections 1.1–1.7) have been **completely removed**.\n*   **Removal of Representation (v3.1.1):** Section 4.4.4 of v2.0 (Domestic Content Level representation) was removed in v3.1.1.\n*   **Addition of \"Prescribed Form\":** Version 3.1.1 introduces the requirement for using \"Prescribed Forms\" for notices, amendments, and contact updates (Sections 5.1.2, 7.2, 8.1, 9).\n*   **Refined Appendix C Definitions:** The definition of \"Existing Building\" in Appendix C was expanded in v3.1.1 to allow OPA discretion for deeming certain buildings as \"existing.\"\n*   **Project Eligibility (Appendix A):** Version 3.1.1 adds a provision in the \"Project Eligibility Requirements\" definition allowing OPA to provide written consent for projects that previously reached commercial operation (item c), which was strictly prohibited in v2.0.\n\n**3. Moved/Missing Elements:**\n*   **Minimum Required Domestic Content Level:** Present in Part 1, Section B(5)(iv) of v2.0; missing/removed in v3.1.1.\n*   **Website Definition:** Added to Appendix A in v3.1.1; not present in v2.0."}, :duration-ms 7095, :event/tags #{[:tick #uuid "b0d2f28a-c554-4adb-b103-20243dd4986a"] [:node #uuid "896c315f-0f84-4ae8-8328-94371ccdc6c6"] [:sheet #uuid "34e58be0-18b2-4d70-92cd-b0a687f47cef"]}, :event/timestamp #time/offset-date-time "2026-05-19T21:09:11.927307-05:00", :usage {:prompt-tokens 25442, :completion-tokens 993, :total-tokens 26435}, :status :success, :node-id #uuid "896c315f-0f84-4ae8-8328-94371ccdc6c6", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-completed, :sheet-id #uuid "34e58be0-18b2-4d70-92cd-b0a687f47cef", :event/id #uuid "019e4324-e4f7-70a9-b59c-a0b14425966d"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3Z1QQJfCx3fXKJV8jl03hGo-gHJC_5", :mulog/timestamp 1779242951929, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3Z1QQJfCx3fXKJV8jl03hGo-gHJC_5", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
